# Policy Hub Integration Plan

This plan introduces a new **Policy Hub** tab in the enterprise spend management system to display category-specific limits, compliance rules, cost-center structures, and SLA workflows retrieved from the configuration rules in the `agents` folder.

## User Review Required

> [!NOTE]
> The new page is positioned as a tab in the Sidebar immediately below **Notifications**.
> It displays high-fidelity interactive sections:
> - **Category Limits & Thresholds**: Expense limits per category (Meals, Travel, Client Relations, Office).
> - **Receipt Compliance**: Rules regarding the $25 receipt requirement and duplicate validation.
> - **Department Cost Centers**: Cost center mappings by department.
> - **Workflow & Escalation SLAs**: Dynamic visual diagram of the 48-hour SLA escalation chain.

